在活动上见到了客户“明日璀璨”，这是第 4 次拜访，拜访的是 CEO。目前这个客户处于方案沟通阶段，希望通过这次活动进一步触达到 CEO，并尽快推动试用。客户非常关注团队协作模块，希望约见我们的 CEO，明确产品的使用权益和效果。他们主要的需求场景是合同管理、客户管理、资产管理。今天达成的结论是：CEO 对产品很感兴趣，但实际收益需要验证。不过也有一些风险，就是 CIO 等角色正在与竞品接触，需要尽快影响。"}], "modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164"}, "flduPeIo7L": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "1. 安排我方CEO与客户“明日璀璨”的CEO会面，重点沟通产品使用权益和效果，尤其是客户关注的团队协作模块。\n2. 针对客户主要需求场景（合同管理、客户管理、资产管理），准备详细资料以展示产品在这些方面的优势和收益，验证实际收益，消除客户疑虑。\n3. 尽快制定应对策略，对CIO等角色施加影响，减少竞品接触带来的风险。"}]}, "fldLrFLTS4": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": "optvVjpZFM"}, "fldrbwZdKf": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": "optT8D3Pmg"}, "fldlZFtD9N": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "通过活动进一步触达客户“明日璀璨”的CEO，推动试用，约见己方CEO明确产品使用权益和效果，尽快影响正在与竞品接触的CIO等角色以应对风险。"}]}, "fld3k7cYpJ": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": {"users": [{"name": "Cayson", "enName": "Cayson", "avatarUrl": "https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v3_00e6_4fd24c8c-875f-49c5-a62a-0f02145ff80g~?image_size=72x72&cut_type=default-face&quality=&format=jpeg&sticker_format=.webp", "mentionId": "7434405856558596099", "notify": true, "userId": "7408098657450737665"}]}}, "fldnwdVg3A": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": null}, "fldMDFWobr": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": {"groups": [{"id": "7434383224094539779", "name": "商机同步群", "avatarUrl": "https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v3_00gd_4448f550-1df3-4ef3-8e0e-f5b78301684g~?image_size=72x72&cut_type=&quality=&format=image&sticker_format=.webp", "linkToken": "509n55c2-3ff1-4a72-899d-8c186f65c099"}]}}, "fldKoxw8Nk": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "明日璀璨"}]}, "flddMHQbVx": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "客户跟进"}]}, "fld7dN8BUX": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": "opttReLr5T"}, "fldrasFbXc": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": ["optqi6ypmL", "optKzf6vr4", "optB7W14ed"]}, "fld72ZarzM": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "这是第4次拜访客户“明日璀璨”的CEO，客户处于方案沟通阶段，关注团队协作模块，希望约见己方CEO明确产品使用权益和效果，需求场景为合同管理、客户管理、资产管理，CEO对产品感兴趣但收益需验证，同时存在CIO等角色与竞品接触的风险需要尽快影响。"}]}, "fldTJddQ7z": {"modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": 1730957099, "modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164"}, "fldVJm80DI": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": "optuXqrIpr"}, "fldumZ7Nv5": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": 4}, "fldJuA0Gp8": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": null}, "fld1mWSUC5": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": {"users": [{"avatarUrl": "https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v3_00er_1cf0e4b7-6bf2-4b70-859d-533ccc22a08g~?image_size=72x72&cut_type=default-face&quality=&format=jpeg&sticker_format=.webp", "userId": "7411435805534683164", "name": "王大仙", "enName": "王大仙"}]}}, "flddjbbzew": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "CIO等角色正在与竞品接触，可能会影响本公司产品的推进，导致失去该客户。"}]}, "fld8AxZNRD": {"value": ["optgScpzoR"], "modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503}, "fldK0uwo3s": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": 1730957098163}, "fld7FEybb7": {"value": [{"text": "https://applink.feishu.cn/client/chat/open?chatId=7434383224094539779&position=22", "link": "https://applink.feishu.cn/client/chat/open?chatId=7434383224094539779&position=22", "type": "url"}], "modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503}}, "recutpRDnXVc56": {"fldumZ7Nv5": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": 4}, "fld72ZarzM": {"value": [{"type": "text", "text": "今天与百盛CTO第四次拜访，客户处于方案沟通阶段，关注团队协作模块且希望约见CEO明确产品使用权益和效果，主要场景为门店巡检、客户管理、资产管理，对产品感兴趣但有额外考虑且希望进一步验证产品在各场景下的重合度。"}], "modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503}, "fld7dN8BUX": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": "opttReLr5T"}, "fldVJm80DI": {"modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": "optuXqrIpr", "modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164"}, "fldnwdVg3A": {"value": null, "modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503}, "flduPeIo7L": {"value": [{"type": "text", "text": "1. 安排CEO与百盛CTO的约见，以便明确产品使用权益和效果。\n2. 针对客户关注的额外考虑，进一步验证产品在门店巡检、客户管理、资产管理等场景下的重合度。"}], "modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503}, "fldh0DFncl": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "客户跟进，今天我在活动上见到了客户，百盛啊，就是第四次拜访啊，目前这个拜访的对象是 CTO，目前这个客户处于方案沟通阶段，那希望这次活动能够进一步的去推进流程，推动试用客户比较关注团队协作模块啊，希望约见我们的 CEO，明确产品的使用权益和效果，他们的主要场景是门店巡检、客户管理、资产管理。今天达成的结论是，啊啊，对产品挺感兴趣，然后，但是呢，目前有一些啊，额外的一些这个考虑啊，希望说能够进一步的去验证产品在各个场景下的一个重合度"}]}, "fldJuA0Gp8": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": null}, "fldKoxw8Nk": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "百盛"}]}, "fldLrFLTS4": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": "optvVjpZFM"}, "flddMHQbVx": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "客户跟进"}]}, "flddjbbzew": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "潜在风险包括：客户处于方案沟通阶段，虽对产品感兴趣但有额外考虑，可能导致合作推进受阻；客户希望验证产品在各场景下的重合度，若验证结果不佳可能影响合作；客户希望约见CEO明确产品使用权益和效果，若CEO无法满足约见要求或者在会面中未能清晰解释权益和效果，可能使客户对产品的信任度和合作意向降低。"}]}, "fldlZFtD9N": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "通过活动进一步推进流程，满足客户对团队协作模块的关注并推动试用，约见CEO明确产品使用权益和效果，验证产品在客户主要场景（门店巡检、客户管理、资产管理）下的重合度。"}]}, "fld7FEybb7": {"value": [{"text": "https://applink.feishu.cn/client/chat/open?chatId=7434383224094539779&position=25", "link": "https://applink.feishu.cn/client/chat/open?chatId=7434383224094539779&position=25", "type": "url"}], "modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503}, "fldMDFWobr": {"value": {"groups": [{"avatarUrl": "https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v3_00gd_4448f550-1df3-4ef3-8e0e-f5b78301684g~?image_size=72x72&cut_type=&quality=&format=image&sticker_format=.webp", "linkToken": "6b7p9468-6bd2-41ec-94f7-433caafe5bb4", "id": "7434383224094539779", "name": "商机同步群"}]}, "modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503}, "fld1mWSUC5": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": {"users": [{"enName": "王大仙", "avatarUrl": "https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v3_00er_1cf0e4b7-6bf2-4b70-859d-533ccc22a08g~?image_size=72x72&cut_type=default-face&quality=&format=jpeg&sticker_format=.webp", "userId": "7411435805534683164", "name": "王大仙"}]}}, "fld3k7cYpJ": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": {"users": [{"notify": true, "userId": "7408098657450737665", "name": "Cayson", "enName": "Cayson", "avatarUrl": "https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v3_00e6_4fd24c8c-875f-49c5-a62a-0f02145ff80g~?image_size=72x72&cut_type=default-face&quality=&format=jpeg&sticker_format=.webp", "mentionId": "7434405856558596099"}]}}, "fldrasFbXc": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": ["optXPJ9ctd", "optqi6ypmL", "optB7W14ed"]}, "fld8AxZNRD": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": ["optktX6Xt2"]}, "fldK0uwo3s": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": 1730957109858}, "fldTJddQ7z": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503, "value": 1730957110}, "fldrbwZdKf": {"value": "optT8D3Pmg", "modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957503}}, "recuPiuYaniYd9": {"fldJuA0Gp8": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1751003204, "value": null}, "flddMHQbVx": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1751003204, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "客户跟进"}]}, "fld3k7cYpJ": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1751003204, "value": {"users": [{"enName": "王大仙", "avatarUrl": "https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v3_00er_1cf0e4b7-6bf2-4b70-859d-533ccc22a08g~?image_size=72x72&cut_type=default-face&quality=&format=jpeg&sticker_format=.webp", "notify": false, "department": "多维表格俱乐部", "name": "王大仙", "userId": "7411435805534683164"}]}}, "fld8AxZNRD": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1751003204, "value": ["optktX6Xt2", "opthXOiOO8", "optgScpzoR"]}, "fldK0uwo3s": {"value": 1751003195792, "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1751003204}, "fld7FEybb7": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1751003204, "value": [{"type": "url", "text": "https://applink.feishu.cn/client/chat/open?chatId=7434383224094539779&position=199", "link": "https://applink.feishu.cn/client/chat/open?chatId=7434383224094539779&position=199"}]}, "fldumZ7Nv5": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1751003204, "value": 3}, "fldKoxw8Nk": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1751003204, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "明日璀璨"}]}, "fldTJddQ7z": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1751003204, "value": 1751003197}, "fldrbwZdKf": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1751003204, "value": "optT8D3Pmg"}, "fldrasFbXc": {"modifiedTime": 1751003204, "value": ["optg9CMZZA", "optg5FG46q", "optIR63CQ4", "optpMLUd7I"], "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139"}, "flduPeIo7L": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1751003204, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "1. 推动触达明日璀璨高层\n2. 约好与明日璀璨的下一次拜访\n3. 为明日璀璨制作详细方案\n4. 尽快为明日璀璨开放主要需求场景（项目管理、车间管理、销售管理和数据分析）的试用\n5. 推动明日璀璨 CEO 的决策 "}]}, "fldh0DFncl": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1751003204, "value": [{"text": "客户跟进，今天我在会议上与客户明日璀璨做了跟进。这是第三次拜访，拜访的是 it 和采购，目前这个客户处于商机确认阶段，希望通过这个拜访进一步触达到对方的高层，并约上下一次拜访制作详细的方案沟通客户，目前非常关注业务经营模块，希望我们下一步能尽快给他们开放试用他们主要的需求场景是项目管理、车间管理、销售管理和数据分析。今天达成的结论是 it 和采购问题不大，基本场景都能满足，但有些风险就是 CEO 正在选型多个软件，需要我们尽快推动决策", "type": "text"}]}, "fldMDFWobr": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1751003204, "value": {"groups": [{"linkToken": "06fs8b58-7d6f-44c4-ab3e-0c01415fc734", "id": "7434383224094539779", "name": "商机同步群", "avatarUrl": "https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v3_00gd_4448f550-1df3-4ef3-8e0e-f5b78301684g~?image_size=72x72&cut_type=&quality=&format=image&sticker_format=.webp"}]}}, "fld72ZarzM": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1751003204, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "1. 今天与客户明日璀璨进行第三次拜访，拜访对象为 IT 和采购，客户处于商机确认阶段。\n2. 目标是触达对方高层，约下一次拜访并制作详细方案。\n3. 客户关注业务经营模块，主要需求场景为项目管理、车间管理、销售管理和数据分析，希望尽快开放试用。\n4. IT 和采购方面基本场景能满足，但 CEO 正在选型多个软件，需尽快推动决策。 "}]}, "flddjbbzew": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1751003204, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "CEO正在选型多个软件，可能会选择其他软件而不选择本公司产品，导致合作失败。 "}]}, "fld7dN8BUX": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1751003204, "value": "optWO0TIbQ"}, "fld1mWSUC5": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1751003204, "value": {"users": [{"name": "王大仙", "enName": "王大仙", "avatarUrl": "https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v3_00er_1cf0e4b7-6bf2-4b70-859d-533ccc22a08g~?image_size=72x72&cut_type=default-face&quality=&format=jpeg&sticker_format=.webp", "userId": "7411435805534683164"}]}}, "fldLrFLTS4": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1751003204, "value": "optiWyil76"}, "fldlZFtD9N": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1751003204, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "进一步触达到对方的高层，并约上下一次拜访制作详细的方案沟通客户；推动 CEO 尽快决策"}]}, "fldVJm80DI": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1751003204, "value": "opt1227508179"}, "fldnwdVg3A": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1751003204, "value": null}}, "recutpQVkoPuDl": {"fldnwdVg3A": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957535, "value": null}, "fldh0DFncl": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957535, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "#客户跟进 今天我在活动上见到了客户“明日璀璨”，这是第 4 次拜访，拜访的是 CEO。目前这个客户处于方案沟通阶段，希望通过这次活动进一步触达到 CEO，并尽快推动试用。客户非常关注团队协作模块，希望约见我们的 CEO，明确产品的使用权益和效果。他们主要的需求场景是合同管理、客户管理、资产管理。今天达成的结论是：CEO 对产品很感兴趣，但实际收益需要验证。不过也有一些风险，就是 CIO 等角色正在与竞品接触，需要尽快影响。"}]}, "fldMDFWobr": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957535, "value": {"groups": [{"id": "7434383224094539779", "name": "商机同步群", "avatarUrl": "https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v3_00gd_4448f550-1df3-4ef3-8e0e-f5b78301684g~?image_size=72x72&cut_type=&quality=&format=image&sticker_format=.webp", "linkToken": "0dfu55ee-ea69-421c-8d45-e3b70e1e9e8d"}]}}, "fldJuA0Gp8": {"value": null, "modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957535}, "fldVJm80DI": {"value": "optuXqrIpr", "modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957535}, "flddMHQbVx": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957535, "value": [{"text": "客户跟进", "type": "text"}]}, "fld8AxZNRD": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957535, "value": ["optgScpzoR"]}, "fld7FEybb7": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957535, "value": [{"type": "url", "text": "https://applink.feishu.cn/client/chat/open?chatId=7434383224094539779&position=6", "link": "https://applink.feishu.cn/client/chat/open?chatId=7434383224094539779&position=6"}]}, "fldumZ7Nv5": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957535, "value": 4}, "fldKoxw8Nk": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957535, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "明日璀璨"}]}, "fld7dN8BUX": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957535, "value": "opttReLr5T"}, "fldrasFbXc": {"modifiedTime": 1730957535, "value": ["optKzf6vr4", "optqi6ypmL", "optB7W14ed"], "modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164"}, "fldK0uwo3s": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957535, "value": 1730956940358}, "fldrbwZdKf": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957535, "value": "optT8D3Pmg"}, "fld1mWSUC5": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957535, "value": {"users": [{"userId": "7411435805534683164", "name": "王大仙", "enName": "王大仙", "avatarUrl": "https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v3_00er_1cf0e4b7-6bf2-4b70-859d-533ccc22a08g~?image_size=72x72&cut_type=default-face&quality=&format=jpeg&sticker_format=.webp"}]}}, "fld3k7cYpJ": {"modifiedTime": 1730957535, "value": {"users": [{"mentionId": "7434405994087448580", "notify": true, "userId": "7428155922389598212", "name": "徐浩", "enName": "徐浩", "avatarUrl": "https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v3_00fs_9e3f46fe-ae00-41dc-b1dc-a8b548ac187g~?image_size=72x72&cut_type=default-face&quality=&format=jpeg&sticker_format=.webp"}]}, "modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164"}, "flddjbbzew": {"value": [{"type": "text", "text": "CIO等角色正在与竞品接触，可能影响本公司产品的推进，这是潜在风险。"}], "modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957535}, "flduPeIo7L": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957535, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "1. 安排我方CEO与客户“明日璀璨”的CEO会面，明确产品使用权益和效果，重点介绍团队协作模块以满足客户关注需求。\n2. 针对客户主要需求场景，如合同管理、客户管理、资产管理，准备相应的试用方案及产品收益验证材料。\n3. 及时了解竞品情况，针对CIO等角色制定相应策略，尽快影响客户决策，降低竞品接触带来的风险。"}]}, "fld72ZarzM": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957535, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "这是第4次拜访客户“明日璀璨”的CEO，客户处于方案沟通阶段且关注团队协作模块，希望约见己方CEO明确产品权益和效果，需求场景包括合同管理、客户管理、资产管理，CEO对产品感兴趣但收益待验证，同时面临CIO等角色与竞品接触的风险，需要尽快影响。"}]}, "fldLrFLTS4": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957535, "value": "optvVjpZFM"}, "fldlZFtD9N": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957535, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "进一步触达CEO，推动试用，约见己方CEO明确产品使用权益和效果，尽快影响CIO等角色防止被竞品抢走，满足客户在合同管理、客户管理、资产管理方面的需求场景并验证产品实际收益。"}]}, "fldTJddQ7z": {"modifiedUser": "7411435805534683164", "modifiedTime": 1730957535, "value": 1730956941}}, "recv7wQaxef6Ri": {"fld7dN8BUX": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1767705540, "value": "optWO0TIbQ"}, "fldrasFbXc": {"modifiedTime": 1767705540, "value": ["optg9CMZZA", "optg5FG46q", "optIR63CQ4", "optpMLUd7I"], "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139"}, "fldh0DFncl": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1767705540, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "@客户跟进系统 客户跟进。今天我在线上开会，跟进了客户锦秋基金。这是第一次拜访，拜访的是 it 和采购。目前这个客户处于商机确认阶段，希望通过这次拜访进一步触达到对方高层，并约上下一次方案拜访，做方案沟通。客户非常关注业务经营模块，希望我们下一步能尽快给他们开放试用。他们主要的需求场景是项目管理、车间管理、销售管理和数据分析。今天达成的结论是采购问题不大，场景都能满足，不过有风险是 CEO 在选型多个软件，希望能够尽快影响到他"}]}, "fld8AxZNRD": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1767705540, "value": ["opthXOiOO8", "optktX6Xt2"]}, "fldKoxw8Nk": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1767705540, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "锦秋基金"}]}, "fldK0uwo3s": {"value": 1767705507875, "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1767705540}, "flddjbbzew": {"value": [{"type": "text", "text": "CEO在选型多个软件，可能最终不选择我方软件，需要尽快影响到CEO以降低该风险。 "}], "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1767705540}, "fldumZ7Nv5": {"value": 1, "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1767705540}, "fld1mWSUC5": {"value": {"users": [{"userId": "7411435805534683164", "name": "王大仙", "enName": "王大仙", "avatarUrl": "https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v3_00er_1cf0e4b7-6bf2-4b70-859d-533ccc22a08g~?image_size=72x72&cut_type=default-face&quality=&format=jpeg&sticker_format=.webp"}]}, "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1767705540}, "fldTJddQ7z": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1767705540, "value": 1767705509}, "fld3k7cYpJ": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1767705540, "value": {"users": [{"enName": "王大仙", "notify": false, "department": "多维表格俱乐部", "userId": "7411435805534683164", "avatarUrl": "https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v3_00er_1cf0e4b7-6bf2-4b70-859d-533ccc22a08g~?image_size=72x72&cut_type=default-face&quality=&format=jpeg&sticker_format=.webp", "name": "王大仙"}]}}, "fldJuA0Gp8": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1767705540, "value": null}, "fld72ZarzM": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1767705540, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "1. 今日线上开会跟进客户锦秋基金，为首次拜访，拜访对象是 IT 和采购。\n2. 客户处于商机确认阶段，希望触达对方高层并约下一次方案拜访进行方案沟通。\n3. 客户关注业务经营模块，希望尽快开放试用，主要需求场景为项目管理、车间管理、销售管理和数据分析。\n4. 采购问题不大，场景能满足，但风险是 CEO 在选型多个软件，需尽快影响到他。 "}]}, "fld7FEybb7": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1767705540, "value": [{"type": "url", "text": "https://applink.feishu.cn/client/chat/open?chatId=7434383224094539779&position=361", "link": "https://applink.feishu.cn/client/chat/open?chatId=7434383224094539779&position=361"}]}, "fldLrFLTS4": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1767705540, "value": "optTCZwVuc"}, "flddMHQbVx": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1767705540, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "客户跟进"}]}, "fldnwdVg3A": {"value": null, "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1767705540}, "fldrbwZdKf": {"value": "optT8D3Pmg", "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1767705540}, "flduPeIo7L": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1767705540, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "1. 尽快给锦秋基金开放业务经营模块试用\n2. 触达锦秋基金高层，约下一次方案拜访进行方案沟通\n3. 采取措施尽快影响锦秋基金CEO"}]}, "fldMDFWobr": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1767705540, "value": {"groups": [{"avatarUrl": "https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v3_00gd_4448f550-1df3-4ef3-8e0e-f5b78301684g~?image_size=72x72&cut_type=&quality=&format=image&sticker_format=.webp", "linkToken": "ab9i4d00-57cf-4d80-809e-7e78236d21c0", "id": "7434383224094539779", "name": "商机同步群"}]}}, "fldVJm80DI": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1767705540, "value": "opt1227508179"}, "fldlZFtD9N": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1767705540, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "通过这次拜访进一步触达到对方高层，并约上下一次方案拜访，做方案沟通"}]}}, "recuubt6elWEBi": {"flddMHQbVx": {"modifiedTime": 1731660654, "value": [{"text": "客户跟进", "type": "text"}], "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139"}, "flddjbbzew": {"value": [{"type": "text", "text": "1. 客户处于商务谈判阶段且正在评估其他竞争产品，可能选择竞争对手而不与我方合作。\n2. 虽然采购经理反应积极，但决策团队还未被打动，存在决策团队不认可我方方案的风险。"}], "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1731660654}, "fld3k7cYpJ": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1731660654, "value": {"users": [{"enName": "王大仙", "avatarUrl": "https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v3_00er_1cf0e4b7-6bf2-4b70-859d-533ccc22a08g~?image_size=72x72&cut_type=default-face&quality=&format=jpeg&sticker_format=.webp", "notify": false, "department": "多维表格俱乐部", "name": "王大仙", "userId": "7411435805534683164"}]}}, "fldlZFtD9N": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1731660654, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "在商务谈判阶段通过展示解决方案满足客户需求、推进合作进程，以应对竞争并争取与“未来之星”达成合作。"}]}, "fld72ZarzM": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1731660654, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "与客户“未来之星”的第5次拜访处于商务谈判阶段，采购经理对人事管理模块感兴趣，我方展示了解决方案，对方反应积极但在评估竞争产品，接下来需安排更深入的技术演示以打动决策团队。"}]}, "fldVJm80DI": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1731660654, "value": "opttoNPI3F"}, "fld7dN8BUX": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1731660654, "value": "opt38HhoPH"}, "fldh0DFncl": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1731660654, "value": [{"text": "#客户跟进 今天我在会议上与客户“未来之星”进行了沟通，这是我们第 5 次拜访，拜访对象是采购经理。目前客户处于商务谈判阶段，希望进一步明确合作细节。客户对人事管理模块表现出浓厚的兴趣，主要关注点在于提升员工效率和优化招聘流程。在这次线上会议中，我们讨论了他们目前的痛点，并展示了我们的解决方案如何能满足这些需求。采购经理对我们的方案反应积极，但提到他们正在评估其他竞争产品，因此我们需要加快推进。接下来的步骤是安排一次更深入的技术演示，以便进一步打动他们的决策团队。", "type": "text"}]}, "fldJuA0Gp8": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1731660654, "value": null}, "fldMDFWobr": {"value": {"groups": [{"id": "7434383224094539779", "name": "商机同步群", "avatarUrl": "https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v3_00gd_4448f550-1df3-4ef3-8e0e-f5b78301684g~?image_size=72x72&cut_type=&quality=&format=image&sticker_format=.webp", "linkToken": "9a2t9d89-2698-4753-879a-1c3a18ac2de2"}]}, "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1731660654}, "fld1mWSUC5": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1731660654, "value": {"users": [{"userId": "7411435805534683164", "name": "王大仙", "enName": "王大仙", "avatarUrl": "https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v3_00er_1cf0e4b7-6bf2-4b70-859d-533ccc22a08g~?image_size=72x72&cut_type=default-face&quality=&format=jpeg&sticker_format=.webp"}]}}, "fld7FEybb7": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1731660654, "value": [{"type": "url", "text": "https://applink.feishu.cn/client/chat/open?chatId=7434383224094539779&position=55", "link": "https://applink.feishu.cn/client/chat/open?chatId=7434383224094539779&position=55"}]}, "fldTJddQ7z": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1731660654, "value": 1731660527}, "fldrbwZdKf": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1731660654, "value": "optT8D3Pmg"}, "fldrasFbXc": {"modifiedTime": 1731660654, "value": ["opt94dFROX"], "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139"}, "fldKoxw8Nk": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1731660654, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "未来之星"}]}, "fldLrFLTS4": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1731660654, "value": "optTCZwVuc"}, "fldK0uwo3s": {"value": 1731660526523, "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1731660654}, "fld8AxZNRD": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1731660654, "value": ["opthXOiOO8"]}, "fldumZ7Nv5": {"value": 5, "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1731660654}, "fldnwdVg3A": {"modifiedTime": 1731660654, "value": null, "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139"}, "flduPeIo7L": {"modifiedTime": 1731660654, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "安排一次更深入的技术演示，以打动客户“未来之星”的决策团队。"}], "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139"}}, "recutq9DK7zVkZ": {"fldLrFLTS4": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1730961583, "value": "optTCZwVuc"}, "fldlZFtD9N": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1730961583, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "触达对方高层，约下一次拜访作方案沟通，尽快给客户开放业务经营模块试用，影响CEO选型决策。"}]}, "fldTJddQ7z": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1730961583, "value": 1730961402}, "fldVJm80DI": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1730961583, "value": "opt1227508179"}, "fld1mWSUC5": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1730961583, "value": {"users": [{"userId": "7411435805534683164", "name": "王大仙", "enName": "王大仙", "avatarUrl": "https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v3_00er_1cf0e4b7-6bf2-4b70-859d-533ccc22a08g~?image_size=72x72&cut_type=default-face&quality=&format=jpeg&sticker_format=.webp"}]}}, "fld3k7cYpJ": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1730961583, "value": null}, "fld8AxZNRD": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1730961583, "value": ["opthXOiOO8", "optktX6Xt2"]}, "fldrbwZdKf": {"modifiedTime": 1730961583, "value": null, "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139"}, "fldh0DFncl": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1730961583, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "#客户跟进 今天我线上开会跟进了客户“明日璀璨”，这是第 3 次拜访，拜访的是 IT 和采购。目前这个客户处于商机确认阶段，希望通过这次拜访进一步触达到对方高层，并约上下一次拜访作方案沟通。客户非常关注业务经营模块，希望我们下一步能尽快给他们开放试用。他们主要的需求场景是项目管理、车间管理、销售管理和数据分析。今天达成的结论是：IT 和采购问题不大，基本场景都能满足。不过也有一些风险，就是 CEO 正在选型多个软件，需要尽快影响到他。"}]}, "fld72ZarzM": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1730961583, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "这是第3次拜访客户“明日璀璨”，处于商机确认阶段，拜访了IT和采购，希望触达高层并约下次拜访做方案沟通，客户关注业务经营模块希望尽快开放试用，需求场景包括项目管理、车间管理、销售管理和数据分析，IT和采购方面基本场景能满足，但CEO正在选型多个软件，有被替代风险需尽快影响他。"}]}, "fld7FEybb7": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1730961583, "value": null}, "flddMHQbVx": {"modifiedTime": 1730961583, "value": null, "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139"}, "flddjbbzew": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1730961583, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "CEO正在选型多个软件，需要尽快影响到他，若不能及时影响CEO的选型决策，可能导致失去这个客户。"}]}, "fldnwdVg3A": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1730961583, "value": null}, "fldKoxw8Nk": {"value": [{"type": "text", "text": "明日璀璨"}], "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1730961583}, "fld7dN8BUX": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1730961583, "value": "optWO0TIbQ"}, "flduPeIo7L": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1730961583, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "1. 尽快开放业务经营模块给“明日璀璨”试用。\n2. 尝试触达“明日璀璨”的高层，约下一次拜访进行方案沟通。\n3. 尽快对CEO施加影响，防止被其他软件选型替代。"}]}, "fldrasFbXc": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1730961583, "value": ["optg9CMZZA", "optg5FG46q", "optIR63CQ4", "optpMLUd7I"]}, "fldK0uwo3s": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1730961583, "value": null}, "fldMDFWobr": {"modifiedTime": 1730961583, "value": null, "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139"}, "fldumZ7Nv5": {"value": 3, "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1730961583}, "fldJuA0Gp8": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1730961583, "value": null}}, "recuxAV4xAPnAh": {"flduPeIo7L": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1734785009, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "安排一次详细的产品演示，以加速决策。"}]}, "fldh0DFncl": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1734785009, "value": [{"text": "客户跟进，今天我和客户梦想启航进行了交流，这是我们第五次拜访，拜访的对象是 it 经理，目前客户处于商务谈判阶段，期待进一步细化合作条款，客户对人事管理模块表现出浓厚的兴趣，特别希望了解其员工在绩效管理方面的应用效果。在这次会议中，我们探讨了他们现有系统的不足，并展示了解决方案能够如何有效解决这些问题。It 经理对此反馈积极，下一步我们将安排一次详细的产品演示，以加速决策", "type": "text"}]}, "fld8AxZNRD": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1734785009, "value": ["optktX6Xt2"]}, "fldumZ7Nv5": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1734785009, "value": 5}, "fldJuA0Gp8": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1734785009, "value": null}, "fldVJm80DI": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1734785009, "value": "opttoNPI3F"}, "flddjbbzew": {"value": [{"type": "text", "text": "1. 尽管客户处于商务谈判阶段且对解决方案反馈积极，但在详细产品演示过程中，如果产品未能达到客户在人事管理模块尤其是员工绩效管理应用效果方面的预期，可能会导致合作失败。\n2. 在进一步细化合作条款时，可能会因双方利益诉求差异，在一些关键条款上无法达成一致，从而影响合作的推进。\n3. 虽然目前客户兴趣浓厚，但竞争对手可能会在此期间介入，提供更有吸引力的方案，导致客户流失。"}], "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1734785009}, "fld7dN8BUX": {"value": "opt38HhoPH", "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1734785009}, "fldKoxw8Nk": {"value": [{"type": "text", "text": "梦想启航"}], "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1734785009}, "fld72ZarzM": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1734785009, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "与客户梦想启航进行第五次拜访，拜访对象为it经理，客户处于商务谈判阶段，对人事管理模块中的绩效管理应用效果感兴趣，双方探讨了现有系统不足及解决方案，it经理反馈积极，下一步将安排产品演示以加速决策。"}]}, "fldK0uwo3s": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1734785009, "value": 1734785000246}, "fldrbwZdKf": {"value": "optT8D3Pmg", "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1734785009}, "flddMHQbVx": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1734785009, "value": [{"type": "text", "text": "客户跟进"}]}, "fldnwdVg3A": {"modifiedTime": 1734785009, "value": null, "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139"}, "fldTJddQ7z": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1734785009, "value": 1734785001}, "fld7FEybb7": {"modifiedTime": 1734785009, "value": [{"link": "https://applink.feishu.cn/client/chat/open?chatId=7434383224094539779&position=87", "type": "url", "text": "https://applink.feishu.cn/client/chat/open?chatId=7434383224094539779&position=87"}], "modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139"}, "fldrasFbXc": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1734785009, "value": ["opt94dFROX"]}, "fldLrFLTS4": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1734785009, "value": "optiWyil76"}, "fldMDFWobr": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1734785009, "value": {"groups": [{"name": "商机同步群", "avatarUrl": "https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v3_00gd_4448f550-1df3-4ef3-8e0e-f5b78301684g~?image_size=72x72&cut_type=&quality=&format=image&sticker_format=.webp", "linkToken": "cf7sf945-53f4-4b26-babd-5c501782879a", "id": "7434383224094539779"}]}}, "fld1mWSUC5": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1734785009, "value": {"users": [{"userId": "7411435805534683164", "name": "王大仙", "enName": "王大仙", "avatarUrl": "https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v3_00er_1cf0e4b7-6bf2-4b70-859d-533ccc22a08g~?image_size=72x72&cut_type=default-face&quality=&format=jpeg&sticker_format=.webp"}]}}, "fldlZFtD9N": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1734785009, "value": [{"text": "推进与梦想启航客户（it经理）的商务谈判进程，进一步细化合作条款，针对客户感兴趣的人事管理模块（员工绩效管理方面应用效果），通过展示解决方案解决现有系统不足，安排产品演示以加速决策。", "type": "text"}]}, "fld3k7cYpJ": {"modifiedUser": "7400357681514971139", "modifiedTime": 1734785009, "value": {"users": [{"enName": "王大仙", "avatarUrl": "https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v3_00er_1cf0e4b7-6bf2-4b70-859d-533ccc22a08g~?image_size=72x72&cut_type=default-face&quality=&format=jpeg&sticker_format=.webp", "notify": false, "department": "多维表格俱乐部", "name": "王大仙", "userId": "7411435805534683164"}]}}}}}}